      "heading": "Potentially dangerous",
      "html": "<p>C2 means the fault could become dangerous. It may get worse, or someone untrained may disturb it.</p><p>Examples: poor protection from damage, no RCD where one is now needed, wrong cable sizes, old wiring methods.</p><p>The EICR is Unsatisfactory. Work is needed. In a rental, the landlord must do it within 28 days, or sooner if the report says so.</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "default",
