      "heading": "Improve, or look closer",
      "html": "<p>C3 means an improvement is recommended. The installation is not dangerous. A report with only C3 codes is Satisfactory. The client decides.</p><p>FI means further investigation. Use it when you cannot judge part of the installation, such as hidden wiring. The EICR stays Unsatisfactory until it is resolved.</p><p>Do not use FI to avoid a hard call. Say what must be checked and what access you need.</p>"
